5. Non-Functional Requirements
The system should:
Be easy to maintain.
Support future scalability.
Reduce manual effort for IT staff.
Provide consistent ticket classification.
Improve ticket routing efficiency.
6. Category and Subcategory Requirements
The system uses the following classification structure:
Category
Subcategory
Network
Wi-Fi
Hardware
Projector
Access
Forgot Password
Performance
Slow Computer
The Subcategory field is dependent on the selected Category. �
