7. Automation Requirements
The Flow Designer should automatically identify keywords in the ticket description and classify the ticket accordingly.
Examples include:
Wi-Fi / Network → Network → Wi-Fi
Projector / Hardware → Hardware → Projector
Password / Login / Forgot Password → Access → Forgot Password
Slow / Hanging / Slow Computer → Performance → Slow Computer
The project document specifies these classification branches for the flow. �
